        "description": "Safa is a minimal and lightweight WordPress block theme, designed with full site editing capabilities. It’s perfect for achieving top scores on tools like Google PageSpeed, GTmetrix, and Pingdom. Ideal for blogs, this responsive theme offers four unique styles, easy-to-read fonts, well-balanced color schemes, and a built-in dark mode. Best of all, it’s free to use!"
